# 🎙️ VANI.AI – Intelligent Real-Time Speech Recognition

VANI.AI is a multilingual, real-time speech recognition and transcription platform that converts spoken language into readable text.

The project focuses on improving transcription accuracy, especially when handling technical terminology, scientific vocabulary, abbreviations, mathematical expressions, and structured information.

## ✨ Features

- **Real-Time Speech Transcription** – Converts spoken input into text.
- **Multilingual Support** – Supports transcription across multiple languages.
- **Technical Vocabulary Recognition** – Focuses on technical terms, scientific words, and abbreviations.
- **Structured Information Processing** – Aims to handle formulas, symbols, and structured content.
- **Interactive User Interface** – Displays live transcription results.
- **Offline Transcription Support** – Includes a Whisper-based offline transcription approach.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript | Frontend development |
| Python | Backend processing |
| FastAPI | Backend API |
| WebSockets | Real-time communication |
| Speechmatics | Speech recognition |
| Whisper | Speech recognition and offline transcription |
| Google Translate API | Language translation |
| WebAssembly | Browser-based offline processing |

## ⚙️ How It Works

1. The user provides audio input through the web interface.
2. The audio is processed by the speech recognition system.
3. Spoken language is converted into text.
4. Transcription results are delivered to the frontend.
5. The interface displays the generated transcription in real time.

## 🎯 Project Objective

The primary objective of VANI.AI is to make speech recognition more effective in technical and educational environments by addressing challenges involving specialized terminology, scientific expressions, formulas, symbols, and structured information.

## 🚀 Future Enhancements

- Improve recognition of domain-specific vocabulary.
- Enhance mathematical expression and scientific notation handling.
- Improve transcription accuracy.
- Expand language support.
- Enhance structured information extraction.

## 📌 Project Details

- **Project Name:** VANI.AI
- **Project Type:** Real-Time Speech Recognition Platform
